# update_bathym/ pipeline + review data -- app.py (the deployed site) only reads
# update_bathym/gage_uncertainty.csv, update_bathym/usace_river_mile_markers.csv, and
# the per-year *_combined_depth_polygons*.geojson files in update_bathym/data/DepthPolygons/.
# Everything below is used only by app_survey_map.py and the update_bathym/*.py scripts,
# which run locally/in CI, not in the Hetzner container -- excluding them keeps those
# ~780MB out of the Docker build context and image.
update_bathym/HistoricDepthPolygons/
update_bathym/UMDepthPolygons/
update_bathym/UnprocessedDepthPolygons/
update_bathym/HistoricSurveysToReview/
update_bathym/data/DepthPolygons/LM_*
update_bathym/data/DepthPolygons/UM_*
update_bathym/data/NAVD88Files/
update_bathym/data/OLDwidthbystage/
